                        <svg class="w-5 h-5" style="color: #059669" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-body-text text-lg">Forex</h4>
                    <hr class="my-3 border-body-border" />
                    <p class="text-body-muted text-sm">Trade major, minor and exotic currency pairs with published spreads and no hidden fees.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-body-border hover:shadow-md transition relative" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563EB15, #2563EB05)">
