                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3" style="background-color: #2563EB20">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5" style="color: #2563EB" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-body-text text-lg">Cryptocurrency</h4>
                    <hr class="my-3 border-body-border" />
                    <p class="text-body-muted text-sm">Access Bitcoin, Ethereum and other popular cryptocurrencies. Markets available around the clock.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-body-border hover:shadow-md transition relative" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #7C3AED15, #7C3AED05)">
                <div class="p-6">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3" style="background-color: #7C3AED20">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5" style="color: #7C3AED" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M20 7l-8-4-8 4m16 0l-8 4m8-4v10l-8 4m0-10L4 7m8 4v10M4 7v10l8 4"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-body-text text-lg">Commodities</h4>
                    <hr class="my-3 border-body-border" />
                    <p class="text-body-muted text-sm">Trade gold, silver, oil and other commodity CFDs with real-time price feeds.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-body-border hover:shadow-md transition relative" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1E3A5F15, #1E3A5F05)">
                <div class="p-6">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3" style="background-color: #1E3A5F20">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5" style="color: #1E3A5F" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-body-text text-lg">Stock CFDs</h4>
                    <hr class="my-3 border-body-border" />
                    <p class="text-body-muted text-sm">Speculate on the price movements of popular stocks without owning the underlying shares.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-body-border hover:shadow-md transition relative" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6B728015, #6B728005)">
                <div class="p-6">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3" style="background-color: #6B728020">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5" style="color: #6B7280" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M11 3.055A9.001 9.001 0 1020.945 13H11V3.055z M20.488 9H15V3.512A9.025 9.025 0 0120.488 9z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-body-text text-lg">Investment Plans</h4>
                    <hr class="my-3 border-body-border" />
                    <p class="text-body-muted text-sm">Choose from a range of investment plans designed around different time horizons and risk appetites.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-body-border hover:shadow-md transition relative" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #D9770615, #D9770605)">
                <div class="p-6">
                    <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-3" style="background-color: #D9770620">
                        <svg class="w-5 h-5" style="color: #D97706" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
                    </div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-body-text text-lg">Copy Trading</h4>
                    <hr class="my-3 border-body-border" />
                    <p class="text-body-muted text-sm">Follow experienced traders and automatically replicate their positions in your own account.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

